  "biome": "vibrant-forest",
  "description": "A two-player woodland showcase on the competitive Amberwake layout. Build on clear colony shelves, scout around the lake, and fight for amber and Root beneath old watches, giant oaks and hollow logs. Four-node sites and mirrored starts follow the competitive foundation; wider balance remains a playtest.",
